  "worked_solution": "Of the given options, we consider the row operation \n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{1}.\n$$\n\nApplying the above row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-3)\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -7 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{1}.\n$$",
